~
> speech_prog 'liquid mana'~
say The ancient ghoul Master Mage found a way to withdraw the very magic from
say the Realm, and concentrate it for later use.  Just one of these rare and expensive
say vials can refresh nearly the entire mana store of a mighty hero.  Guaranteed to
say turn the tide of a drawn-out battle!



~
> speech_prog 'ambrosia'~
say Ahh, ambrosia...the drink of the Gods!  This drink can heal nearly all the but
say the most severe of wounds.  It's rare and expensive, but can turn the tide in
say a vicious battle!


~
> speech_prog 'a vicious trident'~
say Once wielded by Dagon himself, this horrible weapon is huge, requiring two hands
say to wield.  It throws lightning bolts at your foes, while granting resistance from the
say same types of attacks.  It was said to also protect the wielder from paralysis.


~
> speech_prog 'the Breastplate of Dreams'~
say A most powerful piece of body armor, this breastplate was forged in the land of
say Nightmare.  It grants awesome protection to the wearer, and boosts their life
say and magical power up to unheard of levels!



~
> speech_prog 'the Medallion of Nature'~
say This medallion is forged of bramble, thorn and earth.  Yet within it lies great
say magical properties.  It allows the wearer to understand any creature, as well as
say provide a massive boost to the physical speed of the wearer.~
> speech_prog 'the Anklet of Erebus'~
say This anklet was foundin the possesion of a mad lunatic that spke of a twisted place
say full of unimaginable horrors.  The painful barbs and razors provide great strength in
say combat, as well as increasing the amount of pain one can take in battle.
~
> speech_prog 'an obsidian shield'~
say This great shield was crafted by the mighty Thorne himself, just before he was
say overthrown by the mighty Paul.  Its razor sharp edges and lightweight frame make
say it an ideal shield for combat, and the magic imbued within protects the wielder
say against magic and energy as well as physical strikes.
~
> speech_prog 'a belt of dragon teeth'~
say This trophy was taken by the great Taren Koth himself after he slayed the ten
say greater dragons of the Realm.  A great fang from each of the dragons dangles
say from the belt, offering great enchantments against acid and poison, plus boosting
say the combat readyness of the wearer.~
> speech_prog 'the Boots of Bone'~
say These wicked boots were made from the very bones of the great Elder Spawn
say that fell in combat.  They provide an awesome boost to the combat savvy
say of the wearer.

~
> speech_prog 'the Gloves of the Astral'~
say These amazing gloves are forged from a material that is as light as air, yet as durable
say as dragonscales.  They provide a boost to the magic of the wearer as well as shielding
say them from offensive magics and even nonmagic sources.



~
> speech_prog 'a Token of the Elder Gods'~
say A hideous badge, this token grants the wearer much strengh in combat,
say both in attacking and recieving damage.  Unfortunately, it is very recognizable
say and few like to do business with a worshipper of the Old Ones...



~
> speech_prog 'the Greaves of Khent'~
say Not many realize it, but Alden's very own armorer, Khent, was quite a
say hero back in the day.  His pants were one of the pieces that helped him most
say in combat, after a combat-wizard put a few spells on them. They made him
say quite hard to hit, while allowing him to strike harder and more accurately.


~
> speech_prog 'the Blood Scabbard of Fury'~
say Worn on the back of Fury in the days of Old, this scabbard used to hold
say his mighty weapons and possesions safe from all harm.  Unburnable by the
say mightiest of dragons and Gods, it grants the wearer protection from
say paralyzing affects, plus the damage and stamina of the Greater God, Fury.


~
> speech_prog 'a Feather of Cahel'~
say This black feather has fallen from the wings of the great blade-lord Cahel
say himself.  When held this powerful relic provides divine protection as well as
say aiding aim and boosting the physical and mental capacities of the holder.
~
> speech_prog 'the Sigil of the Ghoul King~
shake self
say An artifact given by the Ghoul King himself...this sigil contains the pent up fury
say of Drazuk.  The bearer becomes more accurate in combat, for more damaging
say hits.  Not only does it help resist magic, but it is capable of sending forth some of
say Drazuk's own mighty astral rifts!
~
> speech_prog 'the Circlet of Jaren'~
say So, you want to know about the Circlet of Jaren, eh?
say Once thought lost forever, the mystical Circlet of Jaren is a magical crown that
say grants the wisdom and insight of the Demigod of Wisdom.  It also assists with
say landing a damaging blow on your enemy, and protecting from the cold of the empty
say darkness.~
> speech_prog 'the jesters trousers'~
say Ahhh, yes, the jesters trousers, now those are quite interesting...
say A strange pair of patched and colorful pants, these magical trousers grant the wearer
say a mystical means of avoiding damage, while assisting with lashing out with insulting
say harm.  Noone dances quite like the jester wearing this pants!
~
> speech_prog 'the Silken Glove of Ashlyn'~
say There's quite a history behind the Silken Glove of Ashlyn...
say The Demigoddess Ashlyn is Queen of the Night, and those who worship it.  At times
say she has been know to award adventurers with special gifts, besides those given with
say her sharp fangs.  This special glove was used by the ghoul Battlesister Elinda to
say batter her foes in the war to seal the Elder Ones.  It freezes your foes, and also
say helps you parry attacks, as you dance around the enemy!~
> speech_prog 'the Claw of Thorne'~
say An interesting item, that Claw of Thorne...
say Back in the ancient times, the Demigod Thorne was asked to perform a special
say duty for Drazuk.  Thorne did not follow Drazuks orders, and as such, was punished in
say a special way.  After being tortured in magical fire, his left hand was severed, and cast
say to the winds.  It drips with acid, and boosts the constitution of the wielder!
~
> speech_prog 'the Helm of Fire'~
say Wonderful story behind the Helm of Fire...
say Crafted by the mighty elven mages of the western forests, this helm was crafted for
say Elven warriors that were attempting to rid the Elder Forest of the great red dragon.
say It grants intelligence, constitution, extra damage, and immunity to fire!

~
> speech_prog 'the Mask of Triton'~
say Let me give you a little history about the Mask of Triton...
say Worn once by the God of the Sea himself, this strange mask gives the wearer the
say ability to breath water as if it was air, and gives immunity to the cold of the sea.  It helps
say keep the wearers constitution high, despite the rigors of the water, and also assists
say in combat, adding more damage to your attacks.~
> speech_prog 'an adventurers torch'~
say An interesting object, the adventurers torch...
say A mighty object indeed, this is the same torch used to light the way for many famous
say hero's of the realm.  Providing a boost to the users life force, it also enhances the armor
say of the torch-bearer.  The blessings of the Gods radiates from the light, causing your enemies
say attacks to lose much of their strength before they land, causing less damage.~
> speech_prog 'a bit of starlight'~
say Ahh, let me tell you about a bit of starlight...
say Caught and contained by the Queen of the Elves, this small jar holds a tiny piece of
say brilliant starlight.  It's bright light guides your arm in combat, causing you to hit harder and
say more often in combat.  Giving the wearer a shield of ice, and helping resist certain energy spells,
say the light also helps protect from paralysis.~
> speech_prog 'the Robe of the Saints'~
say Have I told you about the Robe of the Saints?
say Used to cover the bodies of special Ghoul priestesses, these magical robes grant
say the powers of the Gods to their wearers.  The ability to resist all magical attacks and
say even shrug off the spells of their enemies, the robes also grant great wisdom and an
say increase in mana reserves.~
> speech_prog 'a mystical tattoo'~
say A mysterious object, the mystical tattoo...
say The jungle tribes of the southern jungle make a magical ink using the blood of various
say fantastic monsters.  This ink is then used to create a tattoo on their ankle, which gives
say the wearer great strength and constitution.  Life force is also boosted by a large amount,
say allowing the user to stand longer in combat.
~
> speech_prog 'a samurai shield'~
say Let me tell you about the samurai shield...
say Another device of war from the far east, this light bamboo shield is a warriors best
say friend in combat.  The magic of the shield gifts its user with much dexterity and a
say hefty boost to constitution.  Being that it is easy to manuever with such a light shield,
say the wearer can also fight better, landing more hits, for more damage.~
> speech_prog 'the Wings of Icarus'~
say Have I told you the tale of the Wings of Icarus?
say A magical set of wings, crafted to be worn on the arms, these fantastic items do
say exactly what you'd think...allow the gift of flight.  Having gone through many revisions,
say these wings also provide resistance to energy and paralysis and bless the wearer with
say good luck.  They also help you move quite quickly!
~
> speech_prog 'a mage cloak'~
say Ahh, yes....the mage cloak...
say Given as rewards to the mages of the Ghouls, these cloaks drape across the wearers
say neck, and provide much power over magic.  The wearers intellect is boosted by a large
say amount, they have a huge increase in mana reserves, and the spells of their enemies are
say sometimes reflected away, causing less damage.  Finally, a shield of pure lightining surrounds
say the wearer, zapping anyone who attacks!
~
> speech_prog 'a scorpion bow'~
say A wicked weapon, the scorpion bow...
say Used to hunt the sandy wastes of the southern continent, this strange bow is carved
say by tribesman who worship the stinging scorpions of the realm.  Its arrows are sent quick
say and true at its targets, biting deep into their flesh.  Upon striking, a flesh eating poison
say is injected deep into their veins.  The magic of the bow also protects the wielder from the
say poison of the scorpions.  It takes two hands to wield this mighty weapon.~
> speech_prog 'a steel katana'~
say Ahh, let me tell you more about the storm katana...
say Another weapon of death from the far eastern shore, this long sharp blade is finely
say balanced and cuts deep into foes.  It helps protect against the wild breath of the
say dragons of the realm, and sends a vicious strike of lightning at your foes!  Few could
say even strike the wielder of this weapon!
~
> speech_prog 'the Monocle of Clarity'~
say There is a fantastic tale behind the Monocle of Clarity...
say Once worn by the mighty warrior-cleric Kell, this shiny monocle helps keep the
say wearer alert and awake.  Resisting spells that cause sleep, the wearer also has
say increased accuracy in combat, and the ability to see all things, near and far,
say including traps!
~
> speech_prog 'the Sacred Staff'~
say Hmm, let me tell you about the Sacred Staff...
say A hefty staff of white oak, some believe this item was sent down from the heavens by
say one of the demi-gods.  The holder of this tool has a boost in both life force and mana
say reserves, and is granted the wisdom of the Gods.  Useful to help parry blows in combat
say it also has the power to divine heal those about you, but only 50 times, and then the Gods
say will reclaim the staff.
~
> speech_prog 'the Bracelet of Earth'~
say An interesting object, the Bracelet of Earth...
say Another small treasure created by the druids of the realm, this wondrous bracelet
say brings great constitution to the wearer, and increased damage in combat.  It also
say provides resistance to life draining, electricity, and other magical attacks.
~
> speech_prog 'a demonic bracer'~
say Let me give you some history about the demonic bracer...
say Found deep in the caverns of the Old Ones, this strange bracer seems forged by
say the forces of Evil and gives the wearer a shield of pure fire!  Also providing
say resistance to nonmagical attacks, the bracer boosts the wearers mana reserves and
say brings lots of luck.~
> speech_prog 'the Girth of the Gods'~
say A fantastic creation, the Girth of the Gods...
say Another creation of the great God-Smith, this mighty girth is formed of tiny links of
say carefully crafted mithril.  It gives the wearer increased life force, and more accuracy
say when swinging a weapon in combat.  It also help protects the user from the elements
say of fire and cold.
~
> speech_prog 'the Tiki Mask'~
say An interesting object, the Tiki Mask...
say A horrible wooden mask brought back from deep within the southern jungles, this strange
say creation was created by a warrior-witch of the jungle tribes.  It grants strength and
say dexterity to the wearer, and added damage in combat.  It also helps the user dodge
say and parry attacks, and track down prey that flees from combat.~
> speech_prog 'the Amulet of the Winds'~
say Ahh, a fabulous history behind the Amulet of the Winds...
say A most powerful amulet, created by the great ranger-druid Daot.  This amulet quite
say simply afforded its user many magical powers centered about the winds.  These
say powers included the abilities to fly through the air, sneak like the wind,
say detect the invisible, and resist the affects of dragon breath!~
> speech_prog 'the Boots of Speed'~
say Have you heard about the Boots of Speed?
say Drazuk started life as a thief, and was also quite frail.  One of the first artifacts he created
say were these magical boots.  Giving him increased dexterity, they allowed him to land
say his attacks more often, and dodge the attacks of the enemy, including even the breath
say of mighty dragons and paralyzing spells of the undead!  Often he could sneak right
say past the enemy with them, and also walk on water!
~
> speech_prog 'the Ring of the Soul'~
say Ahh, yes, the Ring of the Soul...
say Worn by the master monks of the eastern continent, this ring helps them concentrate
say on boosting the strength of the body.  The user has increased life, and a large boost
say to their strength, dexterity, and constitution.
~
> speech_prog 'the Ring of the Mind'~
say Powerful item, the Ring of the Mind...
say Created by the master mage of the Ghouls, this magical ring adds a tremendous boost
say to the wearers magical energy reserves.  It also give the user the gift of insight and wisdom.~
> speech_prog 'the Earring of Thieves'~
say A pretty little thing, the Earring of Thieves...
say A piece of jewelry worn by the feared thief Sturm, this small device give the wearer
say the abilities to see true and understand all.  Its magical sight allows the user
say to pick locks with more skills, place more accurate hits open their foe, and even help
say dodge some other attacks.~
> speech_prog 'an antimagic shell'~
say Ahh yes, the antimagic shell is a strange aura that floats about the wielders back and
say helps resist the affects of magic in various ways.  It also helps channel the absorbed
say magic energy back into the user, boosting their intelligence and wisdom.~
> speech_prog 'the Visor of Elemental Protection'~
say Let me tell you more about the Visor of Elemental Protection...
say Worn by the Mystic Knights, these visors protected their eyes from various magical
say and natural attacks.  Blocking some spells and even the breath of dragons, they also
say provided resistance to fire, cold, electricity, energy, acid and poison!~
> speech_prog 'the Gauntlets of Combat'~
say Ahh, yes, the Gauntlets of Combat...
say The famous gloves of Phooey, the worlds most reknown ranger, they allow the wearer
say a better chance to parry blows, and even dodge other attacks.  They also help with
say the wearer's accuracy and damage!
~
> speech_prog 'Armor of Protection'~
say A powerful object, the Armor of Protection...
say Once worn by Thorne, one of the demigods of the realms, this mysterious armor seems
say to be able to not only block blows, but it also seems to slow most weapons that enter
say its aura.  Adding to life, this armor also protects from paralysis, and
say weapons that cut, pierce or pound!
~
> speech_prog 'the Ring of Battle'~
say Hmm, here's a little history about the Ring of Battle...
say Worn by the Hero, Homer, this magical ring affords great protection from the weapons
say of your enemies.  While also boosting life, the magic of the ring assists your aim
say and the damage done by your weapon.~
> speech_prog 'the Cloak of the Archmagi'~
say A fantastic object, the Cloak of the Archmagi...
say Crafted by the clever Archmagi of the Ghoul kingdom, this cloak fits about the users
say body, giving them much needed protection from attacks.  It also boosts
say the wearers magical energy, and brings clarity of thought to the mind.
~
> speech_prog 'a razor sharp dagger'~
say A scary weapon, the acidic dagger...
say Favored by the thieves of the city, this razor sharp dagger always finds its mark.  Not
say only does it drip with an acidic poison that sears its foes, it also has wards placed on
say it to help protect from any spells sent towards the wielder.
~
> speech_prog 'a battle mace'~
say You want to know about the icy mace?
say The icy mace was found far to the north, in the ice fields that used to be accessible
say from crossing Boulder Pass.  Long since closed, the icy mace was crafted by the evil
say ice dwarves of that area.  Rarely missing its mighty smashes, it gives the user more
say magical energy and freezes its victims.
~
> speech_prog 'a longsword'~
say Ahh yes, the flaming sword.  Found by an adventurer back several hundred years ago, this
say mighty weapon had lay in the cave of the Red Dragon for many hundred before that.   Sharp
say as a razor and balanced by the God-Smith himself, this sword provides life to its bearer and
say sends your foes up in burning fire!
~
