#21092
Sara battle sister battlesistersara~
Battlesister Sara~
A curly haired woman, bearing the mark of the Battle Sisters, walks the path.
~
By the special mark, and curly blond hair, you recognize this woman as Sara,
a member of the Battlesisters, a group of female adventurers who serve the
Gods of Good.  She nods at you, but is obviously headed somewhere, and has no
time to chat.
~
17826817 71311528&320 1000 C
65 0 -300 10d50+3000 10d5+50
0 0
112 112 2
13 13 13 13 13 13 13
0 0 0 0 0
0 13 0 0 1835007 1 0
0 0 223 3153920 0 0 570426352 2621443
> death_prog 5~
pout
say Once again, the Lord Drazuk will give me rebirth!
rinvoke artifact

~
> greet_prog 10~
nod $n
say Greetings $n, I hope you are doing well this day
~
> hitprcnt_prog 5~
snarl
if rand(7)
  say No, I refuse to fall!
  else
  if rand(13)
     say I shall not let you slay me!
     else
     if rand(14)
        say You think you are mighty?
        else
        if rand(17)
           say I shall overcome my wounds!
           else
           if rand(20)
              say You cannot defeat me!
              else
              if rand(25)
                 say Death is not an option!
                 else
                 if rand(33)
                    say Must...ignore...the...blood!
                    else
                    if rand(50)
                       say Gods, I am wounded!
                    endif
                 endif
              endif
           endif
        endif
     endif
   endif
endif~
|
