E
map large directions~
Greetings Adventurer!

In order to get you off on the right foot, this map will attempt to point out
some of the places you can head to find adventure and excitement!  You will
find other roadmaps out in the realm to help direct you to locations in that
general area.

Out The North Gate -- Elder Forest with the Haunted Church at the end of that
road.

Out The West Gate -- The Greenpath.  Elves and forest creatures in the
surrounding areas.

Out The East Gate -- The Ironkore Pass.  Dwarves, giants, trolls and other
mountain-dwelling creatures can be found here.

Out The South Gate -- Down through the plains of the realm, past jungle and
eventually leading to the ocean.
~
