E
sign~
Type 'heal' to see prices for healing.  Then type 'heal (spell)' to have the
healer cast that spell on you.
~
> entry_prog 100~
if ispc($n)
if level($n) == 1
mpechoat $n _whi You cannot proceed until you have reached level 2!
mpechoat $n _whi I shall return you to Eganrac promptly.
mptransfer 0.$n 10300
mpat 10300 mpforce 0.$n look
endif
endif
~
|
S
#21002
The Temple Of Drazuk~
You wander about the hallways of the Temple of Drazuk.  Many tapestries and
pictures hang on the walls, showing the life and times of Drazuk, the Ghoul
King.  You hope that perhaps your picture and tales may be seen and told
within these halls!
~
