#21164
Lair Of The Fur(r)y Dragon~
A voice says "Naw, just kiddin’"...

Welcome to the House of Fury. As soon as you enter this "humble" residence,
you are overwhelmed by the sound of the Eagles playing in the background. He
really did love his 70’s rock. Very plain in design, but this place seems to
be filled with a Mystical power. After all, it WAS made by the Creator, Drazuk
himself. There are a few paintings on the wall, those might be fun to LOOK at
later.

You notice there are many papers cast about, detailing maps on how to kill
dragons, the effects of staffs, wands and other magical information. Stuff
that would make the Great Abatha say his "Achiever" within was showing.  In
the corner you see a finely finished wooden desk that seems to be crammed with
junk he has collected on his journeys into the unknown. He has plenty of
mismatched chairs, every kind from the pelted leather ones to the ones that
fold out with a place for your beer. His bed, a comfy looking hammock, seems
to be untouched and dusty.  He was known for his late nights, adventuring into
the Elders realm or diving into books by some other realm Author named
"Stephen King". Just as you bend over to grab one of these highly prized
novels, a voice from the behind you says, "Hey Pally, wanna Drink? Blood beers
are Fury’s recommended choice".
~
0 271582216 0 0 0 0
D3
Exit description
~
~
8389671 21250 21013 0
E
painting1 thanks~
The last painting, is that of Fury raising his glass of blood beer in a toast.
There is an inscription under the painting...

"I’d like to thank Drazuk for taking time out of busy life to create this
house for me and run the Realm."
"I’d like to thank Paul, Blight and the elder players for helping me on my way
as young drow cleric."
"I’d like to thank Ashlyn and Nameless for putting trust their trust in me."
"I’d like to thank the Scions, for allowing me to lead them."
"I'd like to thank everyone for the good times."
~
E
painting2 demon azathoth~
This is a much smaller version of the painting the Creator made to celebrate
the Scions conquering the Realm of the Elder Gods.  You see Fury gasping for
air and trying to point to Blight and Nameless that Daemon Sultan has crawled
back out of the Black Pentagram ...

The facial expression of Azathoth indicates that is very pissed of about them
killing him once, and planning to return the favor.
~
E
painting3 growth~
This painting shows Fury’s entry into the Scions of Darkness, starting with
the embrace his receive from his Vampiric Goddess Ashlyn, turning him over.
This also shows his rise to power with the help of his many friends,
eventually becoming the Leader of the Scions and his journey to better himself
for the good of the clan. It also shows the Mighty Nameless, kindly referred
to as the "Exp Beast", and Fury reach the Last Ascension together, gaining
experience nonstop for 10 hours.
~
S
